<title>MALTA: SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT MALTA 3-2 IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT MALTA 3-2 IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland beat Malta 3-2 (halftime 2-1) in a friendly soccer international at Ta' Qali stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Malta - Hubert Suda 17, Stefan Sultana 65</p>
<p>Scotland - Christian Dailly 4, Darren Jackson 45, 80</p>
<p>Red card: Noel Turner (Malta) 82.</p>
